{
  "task.43EE8520312AA014.title": "&6 Welcome to Better MC!",
  "quest.20BA4CC6E5A78C21.quest_desc": [
    "At the bottom of the inventory, you may have noticed a search bar.",
    "",
    "This is the &dJust Enough Items&r, or &dJEI&r, search bar. ",
    "",
    "Typing into the search bar will show items that match your search phrase.",
    "",
    "If you type &eWood&r, the &dJEI &ritem list at the right of the screen will show all items with &eWood&r in the name or tooltip.",
    "",
    "Searching &eSlot: Wrist&r will display all items that fit into your Wrist accessory slot.",
    "",
    "Adding a &c@&r at the start of the search query will show the items from a specific mod, for example &e@Handcrafted&r",
    "",
    "You can also search based on an item's tag, such as &e#Wood&r, which will show all items with the &eWood tag&r.",
    "",
    "To favorite an item, press &bA &rwhile hovering over it in the &dJEI &ritem list.23q",
  ],
  "task.6E8542E3E7B1A622.title": "&aTutorial Complete!",
  "quest.703EC4B09C06F6E0.quest_subtitle": "To start the tutorial, click on this quest and read the description.",
  "task.443FE6A04F66FB7E.title": "&6Important Controls",
  "task.075C44E2D9EFF202.title": "&6Inventory",
  "quest.779541A9503D7E57.quest_desc": [
    "Press &bR &rwhile hovering over an item to view its Recipe",
    "",
    "Press &bU &rwhile hovering over an item to view its Uses",
    "",
    "Press &bRight Click &rwhile crouching to hold a block. (Useful for chests, doesn't work on all blocks)",
    "",
    "Press &bMiddle Mouse Button&r to Sort (Inventories, Chests, etc.)",
    "",
    "Hold &bZ &rwhile using a tool with the Vein Mining Enchant to activate Vein Mining",
    "",
    "Press &bM &rto open the World Map",
    "",
    "Press &bU&r to see Player Death History",
    "",
    "Press &bO&r to view the Claiming Screen",
    "",
    "Press &bC&r to Zoom",
    "",
    "Press &bR&r to Ping",
  ],
  "quest.5DDA51BFE3372769.quest_desc": [
    "&9Tasks &rare things that need to be done to complete a quest. If a task is an item, clicking on it will show its recipe.",
    "",
    "&6Rewards &rare what you get after completing all &9Tasks&r. Click to claim.",
    "",
    "The pin icon at the top right will pin a quest to your screen.",
  ],
  "task.4A2CEB81A2CE53FF.title": "&5JEI",
  "quest.703EC4B09C06F6E0.quest_desc": [
    "This tutorial will guide you through some basic features. Don't worry, it won't take &otoo &rlong!",
    "",
    "To start, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New quests will start to appear!",
  ],
  "task.52C146DEAEF6638B.title": "&6 Important Controls",
  "quest.27B307CA1542FFDF.title": "&6Accessing Quests From Your Inventory",
  "quest.27B307CA1542FFDF.quest_desc": [
    "The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to add other players to your team.",
    "",
    "On the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, which allows you to access the &6Quest Book &rat any time.",
  ],
  "quest.7CF08E6061227F58.quest_desc": [
    "The tutorial is now &afinished&r! ",
    "",
    "&l&aMORE QUESTS!&a&l &f&rTo view the rest of the quests, leave this quest screen and put your cursor to the left of the main quest page where the arrow is.",
    "",
    "Feel free to join our &bDiscord &rfor any other questions you may have: https://lunapixel.studio/discord",
